Barbazu are devils shaped like goat-men: horned, with the lower half of a goat and cloven hooves. They carry long glaives, and their beards move on their own and reach farther than the glaive does. A wound from a beard bleeds on and will not close. When the brimorak's burst of flame washed over them, it did not burn them.

Three came out of a burst of red smoke in the trial by combat at the [[Geography/Calaria/Ragged Roost|Ragged Roost]] pilgrimage. The Party killed them, and the wounds they left kept bleeding after the fight was over.
